                "text": "We're excited to announce the reopening of our office at the Thomas H. Corey VA Medical Center to better serve veterans across FL-21.\n\nStarting today, a member of our team will be on-site every Tuesday and Thursday from 9:00AM to 3:00PM to assist with any issues or concerns.\nhttps://t.co/jLPL8H7PVU",
