                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 Health Advisory at Port Mayaca \ud83d\udea8\n\nConfirmed test results show the presence of cyanobacteria (toxic blue-green algae) on the C-44 Canal side of Lake Okeechobee. While no visible bloom was observed, toxic algae can still be present and pose serious health risks. \u26a0\ufe0f Avoid contact with the water.",
