                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Manatees are a Florida treasure and the canary in the coal mine. Their health directly reflects the state of our environment. Fewer than 10,000 remain in our waters as pollution and legacy nutrients kill the seagrass they depend on. A direct consequence of decades of water mismanagement.\n\nThis World Ocean Month, I\u2019m grateful for local advocates like @ManateeCenter and @FLOceanographic and our entire community who remain committed to the fight for clean water and protecting #FL21\u2019s sea cows.",
