                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 Toxic Blue-Green Algae Alert \ud83d\udea8\n\nThe Martin County Department of Health has issued a Water Advisory following the detection of toxic blue-green algae (cyanobacteria) west of Southwest Conners Highway, just north of the Palm Beach County line.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Cyanobacteria is a threat to public health and known to be deadly to pets. Avoid any contact with the water.",
